<title>USA: Roberts Oil sets stock split as div.</title>
<headline>Roberts Oil sets stock split as div.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberts Oil and Gas Inc said Monday its board has approved a stock split in the form or a stock dividend of one share of common stock for every share owned.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid to shareholders of record on May 12, the company said.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose a date of payment and a spokesman did not immediately return phone calls.</p>
</text>
